Hi Vincent,
You are using org.renjin.cran:RMySQL:1.0.52 ?

I suspect this is a consequence of our yet-unfinished efforts to migrate Renjin's S3-based database packages, which include RMySQL to be more compatible with GNU R's S4-based packages. For the time being, our RMySQL package cannot be loaded at the same time as RSQLite or the DBI package.

You can find more details here on this thread:
https://groups.google.com/forum/#!topic/renjin-dev/KifD7NpqqAQ

I expect to finish migrating the RMySQL, ROracle, and RPostgresQL packages to S4 in early 2017.

Best,
Alex

